---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import kjerstiPhoto from "~/assets/photos/founder-kjersti-portrait.jpg";
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  altUrl="/om-oss"
  title="About · EmendaKit AS"
  description="EmendaKit AS was founded in Florø, Norway, in 2022 by midwife Kjersti Grinde. The anaphylaxis kit grew out of an emergency at Helse Førde."
>
  <section class="about">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <figure>
        <Image src={kjerstiPhoto} alt="Kjersti Grinde, founder and midwife" widths={[480, 720, 960]} sizes="(min-width: 900px) 40vw, 100vw" />
        <figcaption>Kjersti Grinde, founder and midwife</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="story">
        <h1>It started with an emergency.</h1>
        <p>In 2019 a patient went into anaphylactic shock. As a midwife at the Women's Clinic at Helse Førde, Kjersti Grinde could not find a kit that met the need, and developed her own with doctors, nurses and pharmacists.</p>
        <p>EmendaKit AS was founded in Florø in 2022, and in 2023 Helse Førde adopted the solution with 120 kits.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }
  .about { padding: 80px 0 96px; }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  figure { margin: 0; }
  figure img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-ink-3);
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 56px);
    line-height: 1.02;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .story p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  .story p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about { padding: 48px 0 72px; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    figure { max-width: 520px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .container { padding: 0 20px; }
  }
</style>
